msgid ""
"When creating invoice lines, values are copied to account.move.line fields. "
"You can use: (1) a field from the billable record, (2) a fixed record as "
"default, or (3) billable field with fallback to a fixed record if empty."
msgstr ""
"Al crear líneas de factura, los valores se copian a account.move.line. Puede"
" usar: (1) un campo del registro facturable, (2) un registro fijo por "
"defecto, o (3) campo facturable con respaldo a registro fijo si está vacío."

#. module: base_invoicing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:base_invoicing.field_product_category__move_line_field_map_ids
