"When creating invoice lines, values from the billable record are copied to "
"these account.move.line fields (e.g. analytic account, parcel reference)."
msgstr ""
"Al crear líneas de factura, los valores del registro facturable se copian a "
"estos campos account.move.line (ej. cuenta analítica, referencia de "
"parcela)."

#. module: base_invoicing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:base_invoicing.field_res_fee__tz
msgid ""
"When printing documents and exporting/importing data, time values are computed according to this timezone.\n"
"If the timezone is not set, UTC (Coordinated Universal Time) is used.\n"
"Anywhere else, time values are computed according to the time offset of your web client."
msgstr ""
"Al imprimir documentos y exportar/importar, los valores de hora se calculan según esta zona horaria.\n"
"Si no se define, se usa UTC.\n"
"En el resto, se usa el desfase de su cliente web."

