"Cuando la fuente es 'Desde campo facturable', debe definirse un campo del "
"elemento facturable."

#. module: base_invoicing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:base_invoicing.field_product_category_invoice_line_field_map__value_source
msgid ""
"Where to get the value: from the billable record's field, from a fixed "
